    <node id="Ontario Low-Income Individuals and Families Tax (LIFT) Credit">
      <data key="d0">Ontario Low-Income Individuals and Families Tax (LIFT) Credit</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Ontario LIFT Credit offers tax relief of up to $875 for low-income workers, contingent upon certain income thresholds.&lt;SEP&gt;Ontario Low-Income Individuals and Families Tax (LIFT) Credit is designed to support low-income residents, reducing their provincial tax liabilities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-af3ccb564fd9b7b3591223bd47140183&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c7bba92e1e9b7a1972810e69c85c424</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772101287</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Ontario Credits (ON479)">
      <data key="d0">Ontario Credits (ON479)</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">Ontario Credits (ON479) is a document that details the various tax credits available in Ontario, including specifications for eligibility and amounts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-af3ccb564fd9b7b3591223bd47140183</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1772101287</data>
