      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Disability Supplement is an additional amount provided as part of the Canada Workers Benefit to individuals eligible for the Disability Tax Credit.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-21d66ea5179b3a914a2b6215ce0d8004</data>
