    <node id="First Home Savings Account (FHSA)">
      <data key="d0">First Home Savings Account (FHSA)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The First Home Savings Account (FHSA) is a registered plan for first-time home buyers in Canada to save for a down payment tax-free, combining features of RRSPs and TFSAs.&lt;SEP&gt;The First Home Savings Account is a new savings account for prospective first-time home buyers, providing tax advantages.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6da06f6e3dca271d80baa141c0aef4d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11a41d513daa1b6c57ef311273744d0c</data>
