      <data key="d0">Non-Qualifying Withdrawals</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Non-Qualifying Withdrawals from an FHSA are withdrawals that do not meet the criteria for tax-free status and are fully taxable.</data>
