    <node id="Combined Strategy">
      <data key="d0">Combined Strategy</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Combined Strategy involves using both the FHSA and HBP for tax-advantaged home purchase savings totaling $100,000.</data>
