      <data key="d2">Manitoba is a Canadian province that raised its Basic Personal Amount and tax bracket thresholds.&lt;SEP&gt;Manitoba is a province in Canada that underwent significant tax reforms in 2024 as part of the Provincial Reforms.&lt;SEP&gt;Manitoba is one of the Canadian provinces that includes various tax credits and benefits in its fiscal policies.&lt;SEP&gt;Manitoba is a province in Canada known for its tax policies, including the Basic Personal Amount and various tax credits.</data>
