      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">New Brunswick is a province in Canada that implemented rate cuts in 2022 as part of the Provincial Reforms.&lt;SEP&gt;New Brunswick is a province in Canada with its own provincial income tax system and specific tax brackets.&lt;SEP&gt;New Brunswick is a Canadian province that provides various tax credits and benefits to its residents.</data>
