      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Quebec is a province in Canada that reduced tax rates in 2023 as part of the Provincial Reforms.&lt;SEP&gt;Quebec is a Canadian province with a unique set of tax credits and benefits that differ from federal guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Quebec is a province in Canada known for its distinct tax structure and social insurance plans, including the QPP and QPIP.&lt;SEP&gt;Quebec is a Canadian province that has its own tax system separate from the federal Canadian Tax Agency (CRA).</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ab4f75162c7c3f14b11acd6de0559574&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e6767fe1983997e5594e2d1e81f3962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-936dddac80917fe456d3727287e9f980&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d33a716738be034afb001ad0bfbefeb</data>
