      <data key="d2">Newfoundland and Labrador is a province in Canada that introduced new top tax brackets in 2022 as part of the Provincial Reforms.&lt;SEP&gt;Newfoundland and Labrador is another Atlantic province in Canada, part of the Atlantic Provinces Income Tax.&lt;SEP&gt;Newfoundland and Labrador is a province in Canada with various financial assistance programs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ab4f75162c7c3f14b11acd6de0559574&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe8637be3ac5b554a9bb36bec631101a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c553d9c05dddfa3309447cb2baa12c</data>
