      <data key="d2">British Columbia implemented the BC Renter's Tax Credit to benefit eligible renters.&lt;SEP&gt;The BC Renter's Tax Credit is a refundable credit introduced for the 2023 tax year, providing up to $400 per year for eligible renters.&lt;SEP&gt;The BC Renter's Tax Credit is a new refundable tax credit introduced in 2024, available starting from the 2023 tax year for eligible renters.&lt;SEP&gt;The BC Renter's Tax Credit aims to support eligible renters by reducing their tax burden.</data>
