      <data key="d2">The Alberta Child and Family Benefit is a financial assistance program providing tax-free payments to families with children under 18, aimed at reducing financial burdens.&lt;SEP&gt;The Alberta Child and Family Benefit provides financial assistance to families with children based on income levels.</data>
