      <data key="d0">PEI Sales Tax Credit</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The PEI Sales Tax Credit provides financial assistance of up to $110 per adult and $55 per child for low-income residents in Prince Edward Island.&lt;SEP&gt;The PEI Sales Tax Credit offers $110 per adult and $55 per child for low-income residents in Prince Edward Island.</data>
