      <data key="d0">NL Low-Income Tax Reduction</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The NL Low-Income Tax Reduction is designed to lower taxes for individuals with incomes below a certain threshold.&lt;SEP&gt;The NL Low-Income Tax Reduction reduces provincial tax for individuals with income below $21,437 in Newfoundland and Labrador.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bcc35deaf2234a3f8713639ffa324b31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c553d9c05dddfa3309447cb2baa12c</data>
