      <data key="d0">NL Seniors' Benefit</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The NL Seniors' Benefit provides financial support for low-income seniors aged 65 and older.&lt;SEP&gt;The NL Seniors' Benefit provides up to $1,444 per year for low-income seniors aged 65 and over.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bcc35deaf2234a3f8713639ffa324b31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c553d9c05dddfa3309447cb2baa12c</data>
