      <data key="d0">NL Income Supplement</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The NL Income Supplement offers additional financial assistance to adults with low income.&lt;SEP&gt;The NL Income Supplement offers $500 annually for adults with income below $40,000 in Newfoundland and Labrador.</data>
