    <node id="BC Sales Tax Credit">
      <data key="d0">BC Sales Tax Credit</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The BC Sales Tax Credit is part of the Climate Action Tax Credit, allowing payments when a tax return is filed even without income.&lt;SEP&gt;BC Sales Tax Credit is a part of the Climate Action Tax Credit that requires individuals to file a tax return to receive payments, regardless of their income level.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ac4a966efafa608e325e5ad271e6360c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-deb12f259747bd99535c1890ffca3b60</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
