      <data key="d0">British Columbia Provincial Income Tax</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">British Columbia Provincial Income Tax refers to the income tax system collected by the province of British Columbia, outlining tax brackets for various income levels across different tax years.</data>
