      <data key="d0">BC Climate Action Tax Credit</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">BC Climate Action Tax Credit is a refundable tax credit provided quarterly with the GST/HST credit, specifically designed to support families based on their net income.&lt;SEP&gt;The BC Climate Action Tax Credit offers financial relief to families based on income and household size.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-deb12f259747bd99535c1890ffca3b60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e6767fe1983997e5594e2d1e81f3962</data>
