      <data key="d2">The Saskatchewan Low-Income Tax Credit provides refundable credit assistance to low-income residents in Saskatchewan.&lt;SEP&gt;Saskatchewan Low-Income Tax Credit is a refundable credit available to low-income residents of Saskatchewan.</data>
