      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Manitoba Education Property Tax Credit aids homeowners and renters with their property taxes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Manitoba Education Property Tax Credit offers financial assistance for property taxes related to primary residences.</data>
