      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Manitoba Primary Caregiver Tax Credit offers financial support to caregivers providing care at home.&lt;SEP&gt;The Manitoba Primary Caregiver Tax Credit provides a refundable credit for individuals caring for family members.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e6767fe1983997e5594e2d1e81f3962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-641c0fe12d176236fe97fad76cedd6ee</data>
