      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Quebec Work Premium incentivizes employment by providing financial assistance based on earned income.&lt;SEP&gt;Quebec Work Premium is a refundable tax credit designed to support low-income workers, with specific amounts available for singles and couples.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e6767fe1983997e5594e2d1e81f3962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-936dddac80917fe456d3727287e9f980</data>
